@*
    The second step of Add agent (local ADR 0052 §3): the registration line the new
    agent's MCP configuration takes, and a copy of it for each client. It carries the
    grant's id and never a secret, because the token comes from the app's broker each
    time a session connects - which is also why it is safe on screen and in a
    screenshot, where the bearer token it replaces was not.

    One block on screen and two copies, because the two clients file the same entry
    under different shapes: the host hands in each one whole, and this component only
    draws and copies what it is given.

    Done is the act that closes the step; there is nothing to save, because the grant
    was stored when the first step created it.
*@

<div class="@ClassValue" data-testid="@TestId">
    <p class="agent-registration__title" data-testid="agent-registration-title">Register "@Name"</p>
    <p class="agent-registration__note">
        Paste this into the agent's MCP configuration. It carries the grant id only.
        The token comes from Backlog each time a session connects.
    </p>
    <CodeView Source="@Snippet"
              Language="json"
              AllowCopy="false"
              AriaLabel="@($"Registration for {Name}")"
              TestId="agent-registration-snippet" />
    <div class="agent-registration__actions">
        <CopyButton Text="@ClaudeCode"
                    Label="Copy for Claude Code"
                    ButtonBaseClass="btn btn--secondary"
                    TestId="agent-registration-copy-claude">Copy for Claude Code</CopyButton>
        <CopyButton Text="@Copilot"
                    Label="Copy for Copilot"
                    ButtonBaseClass="btn btn--secondary"
                    TestId="agent-registration-copy-copilot">Copy for Copilot</CopyButton>
        <AppButton Variant="ButtonVariant.Primary" TestId="agent-registration-done" OnClick="OnDone">
            Done
        </AppButton>
    </div>
    @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Footnote))
    {
        <p class="agent-registration__note">@Footnote</p>
    }
</div>

@code {
    /// <summary>The agent's name, as the step's title says it.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public string Name { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    /// <summary>The registration as drawn.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public string Snippet { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    /// <summary>What Copy for Claude Code puts on the clipboard.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public string ClaudeCode { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    /// <summary>What Copy for Copilot puts on the clipboard.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public string Copilot { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    /// <summary>A sentence under the buttons, such as what the row will say once a session
    /// connects.</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public string? Footnote { get; set; }

    /// <summary>Raised by Done.</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public EventCallback OnDone { get; set; }

    [Parameter]
    public string? CssClass { get; set; }

    [Parameter]
    public string? TestId { get; set; }

    private string ClassValue =>
        string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(CssClass) ? "agent-registration" : $"agent-registration {CssClass}";
}
